<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Jaelly & Dennis Prieto, Epique Realty, collect and use information submitted through this website.">
  <Legal title="Privacy policy" intro="What we collect through this website, how we use it, and the choices you have.">
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>The information you choose to send us, such as your name, email, phone number and the details you share in our consultation, valuation, buyer and site review forms. We may also collect limited, non-identifying usage data to understand how the site is used.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>To respond to your inquiry, schedule consultations, prepare the materials you request, and follow up about our real estate services. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>We share information only as needed to deliver the services you ask for: with Epique Realty, Inc. as our brokerage, and with service providers acting for us. Form submissions are processed by Formspree, which delivers them to our inboxes; scheduling uses Calendly.</p>
    <h2>Calculators and estimates</h2>
    <p>Figures in our agent calculators are illustrative and for planning only. They are not a valuation, financial advice or the terms of any agreement. Opinions of value we prepare are not appraisals.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may ask us to access, correct or delete the information you have shared, or to stop follow-up communications, at any time by <a href="/contact">contacting us</a>.</p>
    <h2>Updates</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. Material changes will appear on this page. Last updated November 2026.</p>
  </Legal>
</Base>
